"""nekozame-theme: nekozame's theme for nekozame-emu-frontend (and ES-DE): each system a page
from an ocean-themed 90s japanese game magazine, printed here from the photos next to this
script, with your games' screens and counts; and the music while you browse.

  nekozame-theme install [--es-de DIR] [--roms DIR...] [--media DIR...] [--ports DIR]
                         [--drawings sharks|machines|both] [--systems SYSTEM...] [--again]
      the theme into DIR/themes/nekozame (~/ES-DE by default), pages for the systems with
      games in them. the game and media folders are es-de's own unless given. --again
      prints every page anew
  nekozame-theme pack OUTDIR [--systems SYSTEM...]
      every system's pages, without your games, and the fonts: OUTDIR/nekozame, ready to
      copy into ~/ES-DE/themes (the releases' nekozame-theme-pack.zip)
  nekozame-theme music on|off [--es-de DIR]
      the music's event scripts in es-de (it runs them on its start, games, quitting)

needs python 3 and pygame (python3-pygame, or pip install pygame), and the noto sans and
noto sans cjk jp fonts. nekozame os sets it all up itself (nekozame-emu esde on).
"""
